#only("1")[#voiceover("The implication is that most investors cannot consistently beat the market over the long term.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("Active management strategies, which try to identify mispriced assets, are unlikely to generate excess returns after accounting for fees and transaction costs.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("Passive investing strategies, such as investing in index funds that track the overall market, are a rational choice for most investors.")]
